	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><em>Placing your hand on a dead body, you invoke a higher principle that requires the victim return to life, such as the completion of unfinished business or the power of love, then place down a diamond that evaporates into curling smoke.</em></p><p><strong>Materials:</strong> You require a <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.GEEqIdVUGNFunaJU]{Small Diamond}</em>, typically valued at 500 gold, which the spell consumes.</p><p><strong>Healing</strong></p><p>You target a dead creature who has not been dead longer than 10 days.</p><ul><li><p>The target creature returns to life with 1 hit point and two levels of &amp;reference[exhaustion] (to a maximum of 5 levels of exhaustion).</p></li><li><p>Any &amp;reference[poisoned apply=false]{Poisons} affecting the creature are removed.</p></li><li><p>The spell fails if the creature is missing an essential body part, is currently &amp;reference[undead], if their soul is unable or unwilling to rejoin their body, or if the target has been dead more than 10 days.</p></li></ul>",
			"chat": ""
		},
